WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
[No audio] The Za11y demo page is open in Chrome.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
The Za11y icon in the toolbar is clicked and the side panel opens.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
"Run Accessibility Scan" is selected.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Results appear: 14 critical, 31 serious and 2 moderate issues.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Selecting "Buttons must have discernible text" shows how to fix it and highlights the button on the page.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.250
More issues are reviewed in the Issues list.
